tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134022156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin","html_url":"https://github.com/didong-lin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/didong-lin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-12T00:21:21Z","updated_at":"2024-12-12T00:21:21Z","body":"> Can you try later versions of Godot Engine to see if the time changes?\n\nThx for your reply, just tested on godot 4.3\nraised this error:\nE 0:00:03:0670   Main.gd:35 @ appendFromScene(): This function in this node (/root/Node3D/@Node3D@2) can only be accessed from either the main thread or a thread group. Use call_deferred() instead.\n  <C++ Error>    Condition \"!is_readable_from_caller_thread()\" is true. Returning: (false)\n  <C++ Source>   scene/3d/node_3d.cpp:821 @ is_visible()\n  <Stack Trace>  Main.gd:35 @ appendFromScene()\n                 Main.gd:26 @ <anonymous lambda>()\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537472747/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817229426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100263#issuecomment-2817229426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100263","id":2817229426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n64Jy","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T15:47:31Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T15:47:31Z","body":"@AThousandShips I can repro that error on the latest. I can't repro the original timing problem because it errors out in 0-1ms with the same error posted. \n\nThat said, isn't the error expected behavior? I didn't think it was thread safe for `append_from_scene` to be working with a node that could be undergoing changes from the main thread. \n\nWhat ends up happening is that [it scans the visibility of the node here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d3bdcac35ac22ee6c4d5d5edc88ba947d0659d5/modules/gltf/gltf_document.cpp#L5848), which triggers an early false return via `ERR_READ_THREAD_GUARD_V` in `Node3D::is_visible`. `append_from_scene` skips invisible nodes, so it ends up skipping everything.\n\nThis does oddly mean that `append_from_scene` returns `Error.OK` when it happens. From its perspective, the nodes are simply invisible, not guarded by a thread guard.\n\nModified MRP with the error values printed: \n\n[100263.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19825615/100263.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817229426/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]